{"id":"0d8f17dcaa965ccb","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-thm-alperin.md","title":"Alperin's Weight Conjecture","display":"thm-alperin — Alperin's Weight Conjecture","type":"conjecture","metadata":{"type":"conjecture","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-alperin","aliases":["58-thm-alperin"],"display":"thm-alperin — Alperin's Weight Conjecture","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-block-theory.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-p-group.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"conjecture"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-alperin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-alperin</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-alperin — Alperin's Weight Conjecture"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"14670fcc367c76d9\" href=\"?note=14670fcc367c76d9\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-block-theory.md\">../batch04/58-df-block-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ac978c566ec8e658\" href=\"?note=ac978c566ec8e658\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-p-group.md\">../batch08/58-df-p-group.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> is a finite group, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> is prime, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> is a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-block of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IBr}(B)\">\\(\\operatorname{IBr}(B)\\)</span> is the set of irreducible Brauer characters in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Wt}(G,p,B)/G\">\\(\\operatorname{Wt}(G,p,B)/G\\)</span> is the set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-conjugacy classes of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>-weights.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlperinWeightConjecture}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AlperinWeightConjecture}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{conj\\text{-}alperin}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AlperinWeightConjecture}_S(G,p,B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left|\\operatorname{IBr}(B)\\right|\n=\\left|\\operatorname{Wt}(G,p,B)/G\\right|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{conj\\text{-}alperin}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AlperinWeightConjecture}_S(G,p,B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left|\\operatorname{IBr}(B)\\right|\n=\\left|\\operatorname{Wt}(G,p,B)/G\\right|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The displayed equality is conjectural for general finite groups; the metadata therefore remains conjecture.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-block-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"14670fcc367c76d9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-block-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-p-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ac978c566ec8e658","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-p-group.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IBr}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Wt}(G,p,B)/G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlperinWeightConjecture}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{conj\\text{-}alperin}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AlperinWeightConjecture}_S(G,p,B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left|\\operatorname{IBr}(B)\\right|\n=\\left|\\operatorname{Wt}(G,p,B)/G\\right|.","display":true}],"bytes":965,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4024","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-thm-alperin.md|58-thm-alperin]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["14670fcc367c76d9","ed71f39f59370734","ac978c566ec8e658"]}